cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "vram-coordinator"
abstract: >-
  GPU memory reservations for concurrent local-LLM workloads on AMD hardware.
  The coordinator keeps a cumulative budget, shares one model instance between
  callers by reference counting, evicts idle models and closes them, watches the
  device for operations that stop making progress, and measures usage with
  lock-free sysfs attributes only, unless the operator enables the contended
  path explicitly.
authors:
  - name: "oscargzss"
